OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham vows end to 'rip-off parking
OL,4,Acharges' under new rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new rules include a cancellation of
OL,7,Fcharges for honest mistakes such as
OL,8,Fstopping to check directions and for
OL,9,Fnon-payment due to broken ticket
OL,10,Fmachines. Drivers will also get a
OL,11,F10-minute window to leave a car park
OL,12,Fwithout facing a penalty.
OL,14,FMotoring groups welcomed the changes,
OL,15,Fbut said more needed to be done to stop
OL,16,Fcharges when the driver had done
OL,17,Fnothing wrong.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
